# Frozen in Ice: "When this Aura enters, tap enchanted creature. Enchanted creature loses all abilities and can't become
# untapped." Cast on Bot1's own Ornithopter with Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U} ({2}{U} exactly): it is tapped and has lost flying,
# and on turn 3 it is still tapped after Bot1's untap step, which the Aura's rule outlasts although the creature has lost
# every ability (CR 701.26b, 613.1f). Bot1's Island, untapped for the turn, is the control.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Ornithopter
Frozen in Ice
Island x4
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Frozen in Ice.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
? Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter.Keywords = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Frozen in Ice.AttachedTo = Ornithopter
